Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:02:11.88,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 辛辛那提 ATP1000 第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:02:11.88,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}霍达尔 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&HFFFFFF&\fs44}6-2 6-1{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 塔比洛 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:02.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Rafa, congratulations once again, a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:02.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,拉法 再次恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.24,0:00:04.74,EN,,0,0,0,,really tight match against Shapovalov,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.24,0:00:04.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,上一场对沙波瓦洛夫很胶着
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.74,0:00:06.58,EN,,0,0,0,,today a match where you won more
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.74,0:00:06.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天这场你赢得更轻松
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.58,0:00:09.04,EN,,0,0,0,,comfortably, what improved in your game
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.58,0:00:09.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,具体是哪里进步了？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.04,0:00:11.02,EN,,0,0,0,,specifically today?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.04,0:00:11.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,说说看
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.02,0:00:13.06,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, I think that match against Denis
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.02,0:00:13.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,对丹尼斯那一场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.06,0:00:15.30,EN,,0,0,0,,gave me a lot of confidence, you know, I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.06,0:00:15.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,给了我很多信心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.30,0:00:18.30,EN,,0,0,0,,push, you know, to the limit, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.30,0:00:18.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,我把自己逼到了极限
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.94,0:00:21.34,EN,,0,0,0,,and I worked very hard to win that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.94,0:00:21.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,为赢下那场拼得很凶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.34,0:00:23.32,EN,,0,0,0,,match, but yeah, everyone, every match
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.34,0:00:23.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,但每一场都难打
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.32,0:00:26.08,EN,,0,0,0,,is tough, you know, so not because the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.32,0:00:26.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,不能因为比分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.08,0:00:28.54,EN,,0,0,0,,result, you know, seems a bit more
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.08,0:00:28.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,看着轻松一些
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.54,0:00:31.30,EN,,0,0,0,,easier, that means that the match is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.54,0:00:31.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,就说这场球好打
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.30,0:00:33.38,EN,,0,0,0,,easier, you know, I think everyone plays
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.30,0:00:33.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,这里每个人都打得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.38,0:00:35.24,EN,,0,0,0,,here very good, so I had to be my best
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.38,0:00:35.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以今天要赢塔比洛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.24,0:00:38.24,EN,,0,0,0,,today to beat Tabilo and I had to be my
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.24,0:00:38.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我必须拿出最佳状态
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.62,0:00:40.56,EN,,0,0,0,,best level, you know, and in all the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.62,0:00:40.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,最好的水平
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.56,0:00:41.56,EN,,0,0,0,,matches here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.56,0:00:41.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,这里每一场都一样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.56,0:00:43.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Tabilo beat you in Indian Wells, it was
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.56,0:00:43.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,印第安维尔斯他赢过你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.64,0:00:45.10,EN,,0,0,0,,a closer match in Washington which you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.64,0:00:45.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,华盛顿那场更接近
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.10,0:00:47.54,EN,,0,0,0,,won today, more clearly in your favor,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.10,0:00:47.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天你赢得更干脆
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.54,0:00:49.30,EN,,0,0,0,,how much do you and your dad spend time
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.54,0:00:49.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,你和你父亲会花多少时间
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.30,0:00:52.02,EN,,0,0,0,,analyzing opponents to work out a clear
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.30,0:00:52.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,研究对手 定出清晰的战术？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.02,0:00:53.68,EN,,0,0,0,,strategy? Well, it's difficult, you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.02,0:00:53.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,这很难说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.68,0:00:55.76,EN,,0,0,0,,know, because I'm new in the tour, you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.68,0:00:55.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,我刚上巡回赛时间不长
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.76,0:00:57.34,EN,,0,0,0,,know, so all the players that I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.76,0:00:57.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,我遇到的球员
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.34,0:00:59.52,EN,,0,0,0,,playing, most of them are new for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.34,0:00:59.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,大多是新面孔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.52,0:01:01.04,EN,,0,0,0,,but I mean, the players that I've
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.52,0:01:01.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,但交过手的那些
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.04,0:01:03.16,EN,,0,0,0,,already played against, it's easier, you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.04,0:01:03.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,准备起来会容易些
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.16,0:01:06.16,EN,,0,0,0,,know, to prepare a match, I could say,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.16,0:01:06.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,大概知道会遇到什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.92,0:01:08.90,EN,,0,0,0,,because you can kind of have an idea
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.92,0:01:08.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为你心里有个数
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.90,0:01:11.50,EN,,0,0,0,,what you're gonna expect, but every
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.90,0:01:11.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,但每场球都不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.50,0:01:13.10,EN,,0,0,0,,match is different, every tournament has
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.50,0:01:13.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,每站赛事条件也不同
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.10,0:01:14.70,EN,,0,0,0,,different conditions, so you just have
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.10,0:01:14.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以你只能
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.70,0:01:16.52,EN,,0,0,0,,to be very focused, you know, on doing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.70,0:01:16.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,保持高度专注
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.52,0:01:18.92,EN,,0,0,0,,the things right, and I think most
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.52,0:01:18.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,把该做的事情做好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.92,0:01:21.40,EN,,0,0,0,,importantly to focus on yourself, you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.92,0:01:21.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得最重要的一点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.40,0:01:24.04,EN,,0,0,0,,know, not focusing on the opponent,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.40,0:01:24.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,是专注在自己身上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.04,0:01:25.48,EN,,0,0,0,,which is also important, but I think
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.04,0:01:25.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,对手当然也要研究
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.48,0:01:27.06,EN,,0,0,0,,more important in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.48,0:01:27.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,但更重要的是你自己
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.06,0:01:28.78,EN,,0,0,0,,Just lastly, you're so good at being
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.06,0:01:28.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,最后一个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.78,0:01:30.18,EN,,0,0,0,,humble and staying in the moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.78,0:01:30.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,你一直很谦逊 很沉稳
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.18,0:01:32.20,EN,,0,0,0,,remarkably so, is there a little boy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.18,0:01:32.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,你心里有没有一个小男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.20,0:01:34.24,EN,,0,0,0,,inside you jumping up and down that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.20,0:01:34.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,在跳起来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.24,0:01:35.88,EN,,0,0,0,,you're winning all these matches?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.24,0:01:35.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,为这些胜利？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.88,0:01:38.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm happy obviously to get this
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.88,0:01:38.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,拿到这样的胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.60,0:01:40.90,EN,,0,0,0,,type of wins, you know, and to be able
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.60,0:01:40.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,我当然开心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.90,0:01:43.90,EN,,0,0,0,,to play in these big stages, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.90,0:01:43.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,能打上这样的大舞台
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.16,0:01:46.98,EN,,0,0,0,,and center court of the Masters 1000 is
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.16,0:01:46.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,站上大师赛的中央球场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.98,0:01:49.62,EN,,0,0,0,,something that I dreamed about when I
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.98,0:01:49.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,那是我小时候的梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.62,0:01:51.54,EN,,0,0,0,,was a kid and when I used to watch all
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.62,0:01:51.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,那时候我在电视上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.54,0:01:54.04,EN,,0,0,0,,the matches on TV, so yeah, super
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.54,0:01:54.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,看所有的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.04,0:01:56.74,EN,,0,0,0,,grateful, you know, that in what
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.04,0:01:56.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以真的很感激
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.74,0:01:59.62,EN,,0,0,0,,position, you know, I am now to be able
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.74,0:01:59.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在能有这样的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.62,0:02:02.26,EN,,0,0,0,,to play, but as always, and I've always
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.62,0:02:02.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,去打这些比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.26,0:02:05.26,EN,,0,0,0,,said to be the same kid, you know, as I
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.26,0:02:05.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我一直说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.02,0:02:08.12,EN,,0,0,0,,was when I used to watch the matches on
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.02,0:02:08.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,要做同一个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.12,0:02:10.38,EN,,0,0,0,,the TV. Congratulations once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.12,0:02:10.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是当年电视机前那个我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.38,0:02:11.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.38,0:02:11.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,再次恭喜 谢谢
